            "review_title": "Review at Korean Nami Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Sandip G\nSan Francisco, California519 contributions\n0\nReliable Korean BBQ in Nha Trang\nApr 2025 • Friends\nNami was a chance discovery while looking out for another Korean BBQ restaurant in the vicinity. But it was happy find. The best part was the friendly service. The staff (probably the owners themselves) were very nice to change an order because we didn’t like it and suggest a replacement which we loved. The beef was great, the pork belly was good too - though not the best we have had. The Kimchis were excellent. And the Saigon draft beer was the right liquid to wash the food down. Overall, a nice experience.\nRead more\nWritten April 15, 2025",
