            "review_title": "Review at Korean Nami Restaurant",
            "review_text": "life&stay\nNha Trang, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nIf you swallow the strawberries.\nJul 2024 • Friends\nLast day of Trips. Vietnamese food was good for a few days, but if you remember the taste of Korean food, the Nami restaurant in Natrang is fine. The kitchen owner is either Korean or Phamingchi is the corean taste. If you swallow a cup of coffee, your thirst for Korean food will disappear. The staff are very friendly.\nTranslated from Korean\nShow original\nWritten July 11, 2024",
