            "review_title": "Review at Korean Nami Restaurant",
            "review_text": "tieu112\nNha Trang, Vietnam104 contributions\n0\nExcellent authentic Korean BBQ\nApr 2019 • Couples\nMy wife and I have come here many times now before writing this review. Since the grand opening and now we come at least once a week, sometimes twice a week. Each time the food was consistent, the small dishes were tasty and varied from pickled veggies, kim chi, to fried shizo pancake. Our favorite cuts of meat are the pork belly and the marinated beef ribs. The sauces paired with the meat are tasty as well. Service is good too. \n\nIt's a very large restaurant with 2 floors and can accommodate large groups. \n\nNami is definitely our favorite Korean BBQ restaurant now. It is own and operated by a Korean and we see many Korean patrons come here as well so it is authentic.\nRead more\nWritten April 22, 2019",
